1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,938
Making fresh pasta at home
is easier than you think.

2
00:00:03,916 --> 00:00:07,028
Pour flour onto a wooden board
and make a well in the middle.

3
00:00:07,996 --> 00:00:11,071
Crack eggs into the well and
whisk them gently with a fork.

4
00:00:12,052 --> 00:00:15,277
Slowly pull the flour into
the eggs until a dough forms.

5
00:00:16,252 --> 00:00:19,364
Knead the dough with your hands
for ten minutes until it is smooth.

6
00:00:20,356 --> 00:00:21,869
Wrap it and let it rest.

7
00:00:22,852 --> 00:00:26,189
Then roll it thin with a rolling
pin and cut it into ribbons.

8
00:00:27,172 --> 00:00:30,959
Drop the pasta into boiling water for
two minutes and serve it with tomato

9
00:00:30,972 --> 00:00:31,972
sauce and basil.
